{"ticker":{"symbol":"291650.KQ","name":"츌립앤사이언스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2235.0,"change_pct":0.009029345372460584,"market_cap":68211351552.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":3996.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.choolipscience.com","business_summary":"CHOOLIP & SCIENCES Inc., a bio venture company, focuses on the Aptamer technology platform for the development of therapeutic and diagnostic platforms. The company's platforms include aptamer discovery, optimization, and the development of therapeutics and diagnostics for cancer and neurological disorders. It offers AlloMAp and Bi-Functional Aptame (BiFAp) platform programs for therapeutics, as well as Aptodetect-lung, an early diagnosis kit for lung cancer. The company was formerly known as Aptamer Sciences Inc and changed its name to CHOOLIP & SCIENCES Inc. in August 2026. CHOOLIP & SCIENCES Inc. was founded in 2011 and is headquartered in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"㈜츄립앤사이언스(CHOOLIP & SCIENCES)는 치료 및 진단 플랫폼 개발을 위해 압타머 기술 플랫폼에 주력하는 바이오 벤처기업입니다. 이 회사의 플랫폼에는 압타머 발견, 최적화, 암 및 신경 장애에 대한 치료법 및 진단 개발이 포함됩니다. 치료제용 AlloMAp 및 BiFAp(Bi-Functional Aptame) 플랫폼 프로그램과 폐암 조기진단 키트인 AptoDetect-lung을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Aptamer Sciences Inc.로 알려졌으며 2026년 8월에 CHOOLIP & SCIENCES Inc.로 사명을 변경했습니다. CHOOLIP & SCIENCES Inc.는 2011년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":358252880.0,"operating_income":-8319877000.0,"net_income":-7115574960.0,"eps":-342.44318},{"period":"2023","revenue":243186320.0,"operating_income":-12206656840.0,"net_income":-13601504420.0,"eps":-1309.293496},{"period":"2024","revenue":1082811700.0,"